  "html": "<p>The Crypt Layout is very popular.  The walls are lined with skeletons, and now and then you will find a <a href=\"/wiki/Sarcophagus\" title=\"Sarcophagus\">Sarcophagus</a>.  These can be opened and occasionally they contain treasure.  There are many closed doors.  If you listen carefully you may hear eerie laughter behind them.  They will slide open when approached and usually have mobs waiting behind them.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<table>\n<tr>\n<th>Crypt Layout Appearance\n</th><th>Crypt Layout Typical Map\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:402px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Layout_Crypt.jpg\" title=\"Layout Crypt.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"245\" src=\"/images/Layout_Crypt.jpg\" width=\"400\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Layout_Crypt.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div></div></div></div>\n</td><td><div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:402px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Map_Crypt.jpg\" title=\"align=center\"><img alt=\"align=center\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"345\" src=\"/images/Map_Crypt.jpg\" width=\"400\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Map_Crypt.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>align=center</div></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
